Read full negative-control cause/tail: removing only the header then regenerating fails delegate identity plus ar/es/vi widget cases; English fallback passes. This is a runtime type/localization failure, not a compile error. Shipped four-case regression independently fails three locales before the generator fix and passes all four afterward.
